description=Replaces the in-game world map and minimap with the painted Zomboid Evolved map (the same map as zomboid.wubcord.app), with the game's own street and place names on top. Printed and stash maps are unchanged. Also shows the Zomboid Evolved badge and map banner in the server browser (while the mod is enabled there). Each part can be toggled off in Options > Mods. Also lights the lamps at the server's defense-line checkpoints. Also carries a small server-side loader for the Zomboid Evolved server (inactive on players' games). Made for the Zomboid Evolved server - a Wubcord World.
modversion=1.2.0
versionMin=42.19.0
